{"reference":"1 Samuel 7","book":"1 Samuel","chapter":7,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"In the Wider Book","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"First Samuel’s wider story moves from Eli’s failing priestly house through Samuel’s leadership, then follows Saul’s kingship and rejection before turning to David’s anointing, rise, exile, and Saul’s death. This chapter belongs within the portion of the book that presents Samuel as Israel’s leader.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_1_samuel_007_c235c0ede02a9f1d4bc47"]}]}],"generated_metadata":null}